 "remarks": "Welcome to this charming 3-bedroom Cape nestled in Stamford's sought-after Springdale neighborhood! Offering a versatile floor plan this inviting home combines comfort, charm and convenience. The main level features a bright and spacious living room which you enter via french doors from the sunny heated enclosed porch. An updated kitchen boasts granite countertops and new stainless steel appliances, while a first floor bedroom and full bath offer flexible living options. Upstairs, you'll find two generously sized bedrooms and a second full bath. Additional highlights include: hardwood floors throughout, natural gas and a large basement with so many possibilities and an abundance of storage space, also a carport for covered parking! Step out onto the deck overlooking a serene, level backyard with plenty of room for entertaining, play or gardening, complete with a storage shed and pebbled area for your firepit! Approximately 1.1 miles from the Springdale train station, with easy access to school, shopping, dining, major highways and everything Stamford has to offer. A wonderful opportunity to enjoy the best of Springdale living!",
